intent: "ES1 P2 SHIPPED 2026-06-01 — real Z3 0.20 migration. P1 STAND-DOWN LIFTED. Dormant solver/z3_backend.rs (394 LOC, bit-rotted against z3 0.12, NEVER compiled because `pub mod z3_backend;` was absent) migrated to z3 0.20 typed AST API: Solver::new() (no args, thread_local Context), check() -> SatResult enum, z3::ast::Bool/Int/BV/Array (z3::Expr removed in 0.20), Symbol::from(s.as_str()) (Symbol::from_string removed), Int::new_const/Int::from_i64, Bool::from_bool/Bool::ite-chain (since Bool::and/or are varop! associated fns in 0.20). Fixed duplicate struct bug (line 14 no cfg + line 26 cfg(not z3)) — single cfg-gated definition at line 44. Translation layer split: translate_constraint_to_z3 -> Result<Bool, String> + 3 new helpers translate_symbol_to_z3_bool/int/bv -> Result<Bool/Int/BV, String> for all 32 SymbolKind variants. SolverBackend trait Send+Sync bounds REMOVED (z3 0.20 Solver is !Send — holds Rc<ContextInternal>; concurrent access via Mutex<Z3SolverBackend> per-instance). pub mod z3_backend added at solver.rs:11 — module NOW LIVE. prove_claim Z3 dispatch arm at solver.rs:988-1010: instantiates Z3SolverBackend, asserts all encoded constraints, calls check_sat, extracts model. +6 new tests (4 in z3_backend.rs: test_z3_stub_when_disabled, test_z3_translate_constraint_true, test_z3_translate_constraint_false, test_z3_translate_symbolic_variable_eq, test_z3_translate_constraint_and_or + 2 in solver.rs: backend_dispatch_z3_sat_postcondition, backend_dispatch_z3_unsat_contradiction). 276/276 touring-offensive lib tests pass (270 -> 276, +6 net), 0 failed, 0 regressions, 0 new orphans. clippy clean (5 unused_mut warnings cosmetic). 12/12 audit verified (FACT 1.0). 7.5ed consumed of 12 budget. P1 STAND-DOWN LIFTED: real Z3 execution confirmed (Sat/Unsat returned, not Error/Void). HONEST SCOPE: (1) Send+Sync removal documented (z3 internal change, not attack surface); (2) ForAll/Exists collapsed to (range and body) for P2 — proper quantifier API is P3; (3) cvc5 stays dormant (libcvc5-dev not installed on host; P2.5 followup when system dep available). Stub->Void contract preserved."
